      "content": {
        "content_kind": "text",
        "payload": {
          "title": "Say what should happen",
          "body": "Write a note, add a picture of the screen and pick where it goes. Send it to your AI or a pursuit, or to the people who make Trillion when something went wrong, you want a change or you have an idea."
